98], carbon-fiber and FlexFoot technologies for feet and dynamic prosthetics [98], 3D-printed modular prostheses from 2012 [98], recent mind–machine interface advances circa 2020 enabling neural control [98], and anticipated roles for AI/machine learning and enhanced sensory feedback systems [98]."
