lenges [106]","Highlights: additive manufacturing/3D printing; CAD/CAM and digital design; machine learning/AI for generative/custom design; smart sockets and sensor-integrated liners (pressure, temperature, fit monitoring); microprocessor-controlled components; apps and SaaS for clinical workflows; osseointegration and implantable neural/BCI interfaces [106]"
